Subject: Chat Workbench Raw Text Tracking Justification
Date: 2026-05-14
Scope: Toggleable raw debug projection tracking for AlienHand refinement state

& [ChatWorkbenchRawTextTrackingSlice] is the raw debug projection tracking affordance
  + [specification_basis] is AlienHand/docs/irc-chat-refinement.sop
  + [processed_specification_basis] is AlienHand/docs/sjs/exploded/irc-chat-refinement.v2.exploded.sop
  + [user_refinement_basis] is the requested raw text show/hide control with an independent tracking toggle
  + [ui_contract] is raw JSON debug projection remains visible on demand and can auto-track updates when enabled
  + [thelounge_commit] is febb33e4
  + [parent_pointer] is AlienHand/thelounge
  + [implementation_files] are The Lounge client/components/AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue and AlienHand/python/alienhand_ai/payload_http.py

  = implemented: added a Track raw text / Stop tracking raw text button that appears when raw text is visible
  = implemented: added trackRawText state defaulting to enabled for visible raw debug updates
  = implemented: added rawTextOutput ref and syncRawTextTracking operation
  = implemented: auto-scrolls the raw debug projection to its latest state when rawDebugText, raw text visibility, or tracking state changes
  = implemented: added Ctrl+Alt+T as a keyboard equivalent for raw text tracking
  = implemented: reports raw tracking state through the existing workbench status pill stream
  = implemented: added runtime proof markers for the tracking action, stop action, status, and shortcut text
  = satisfies: user-requested raw text tracking because the raw projection can now be shown independently and tracking can be toggled independently
  = satisfies: UIInteractionSpecification because tracking is visible, reversible, keyboard reachable, and status-reported
  = satisfies: DataDrivenDesign because raw tracking remains accidental UI state over the raw projection and does not mutate durable refinement rows
  = verification: npx eslint client\components\AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue --color passed
  = verification: npx prettier --check client\components\AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue passed
  = verification: yarn build:client passed
  = verification: python -m unittest tests.test_payload_http tests.test_refinement_storage tests.test_chat_platform passed 45 tests
  = verification: python -m alienhand_ai.cli chat-workbench-runtime-proof --output runs --name chat-workbench-raw-tracking-proof --timeout 45 returned workbench_runtime_ok true
  - compatibility: raw debug content remains the same JSON projection shape
  - never: treat raw debug scroll state as durable source truth
  - never: force tracking on when the user disables it
